    "description": "<p>Carefully positioning herself, the Exalt ensures that her firewand's burst of flame will hit somebody, even if the original target manages to dodge her deadly attack. She lines up two victims before attacking, then looses her flames. If the first target successfully dodges the attack, all the attack's successes are then applied to the second target, who was behind the first. This Charm increases the range of a firewand's attack by five yards, but only if that extra range is necessary to reach the second target.</p>",
